  "title": "AUSTRALIA SATURDAY LOTTO",
  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1698\" class=\"elementor elementor-1698\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6a1cd5bf elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"98596\" data-id=\"6a1cd5bf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-339a0ecc\" data-eae-slider=\"44975\" data-id=\"339a0ecc\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f59c4bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3f59c4bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"382\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/australia-saturaday-lotto.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5817\" alt=\"australia lottery lotto\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/australia-saturaday-lotto.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/australia-saturaday-lotto-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/australia-saturaday-lotto-768x367.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"></figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7d410aa3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"61739\" data-id=\"7d410aa3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-56f9edb5\" data-eae-slider=\"12974\" data-id=\"56f9edb5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79ed2ce2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"79ed2ce2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About the Australia Saturday Lotto\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-33b9520d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"17348\" data-id=\"33b9520d\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2c6975c4\" data-eae-slider=\"49750\" data-id=\"2c6975c4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45b8093c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"45b8093c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While playing from the convenience of their own homes, over 131 million players have won through Australia's official lotteries. The amount of winners so far is impressive. There are 2.3 winners per second, and you could win your share of the $3.3 billion prize money. The prize money ranges from $5 to $50 million and could go higher at times.  </span></p><p><br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What's more is that each time you play, Australia's Official Lotteries contributes to supporting and developing Australian communities. More than $1,4 billion was donated to help schools, hospitals, and sporting groups in the last financial year. So everybody is a winner when it comes to the</span><b> lottery with Saturday Lotto</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> because you are helping advance communities each time you play. </span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-61d53e04 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"76658\" data-id=\"61d53e04\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7f03b995\" data-eae-slider=\"53010\" data-id=\"7f03b995\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35dbf414 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"35dbf414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Australia Saturday Lotto FAQ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4684423a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-eae-slider=\"60932\" data-id=\"4684423a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1c76df40\" data-eae-slider=\"69755\" data-id=\"1c76df40\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9474e elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"b9474e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-b9474e\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"b9474e\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-play-the-australian-saturday-lotto\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1211\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How to Play the Australian Saturday Lotto?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1211\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-play-the-australian-saturday-lotto\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">After choosing any seven main numbers and one Powerball, your ticket goes into the draw. There are nine divisions, and more people playing equates to a larger prize pool.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-does-it-take-to-win-the-saturday-lottery-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1212\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Does it Take to Win the Saturday Lottery? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1212\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-does-it-take-to-win-the-saturday-lottery-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">To be one of the </span><b>Saturday Lotto lottery winners, </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">you’ll have to choose seven winning numbers. Make a selection from 1-35 and one Powerball number from a collection ranging from 1-20. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-saturday-lottery-drawing-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1213\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the Saturday Lottery Drawing? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1213\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-saturday-lottery-drawing-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The </span><b>Results of Saturday Lotto lottery</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> are released every Thursday night at 7:30 pm (AEST) during the Powerball draw. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-cash-in-lottery-tickets-for-the-saturday-lotto\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1214\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How to Cash in Lottery Tickets for the Saturday Lotto?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1214\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-cash-in-lottery-tickets-for-the-saturday-lotto\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can claim your prize money from the provider where you purchased your ticket, or online. The method of claiming depends on how much you’ve won. Refer to the list at the top of the page for the available providers.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"who-won-the-biggest-saturday-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1215\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Who Won the Biggest Saturday Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1215\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"who-won-the-biggest-saturday-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">A full-time nurse and mom won the most extensive single winning PowerBall entry from Sydney. She won a staggering $107 million. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-channel-is-the-saturday-lottery-on\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1216\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Channel Is the Saturday Lottery On?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1216\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"what-channel-is-the-saturday-lottery-on\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The </span><b>Saturday Lotto lottery numbers </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">are aired on 7TWO. You can also find the winning numbers at thelott.com. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-saturday-lottery-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1217\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Odds of Winning the Saturday Lottery? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1217\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-saturday-lottery-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Based on a single standard game, the odds of winning are 134,490,400:1. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"is-there-a-convenient-way-of-checking-my-ticket-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1218\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Is There a Convenient Way of Checking My Ticket? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1218\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"is-there-a-convenient-way-of-checking-my-ticket-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can use the </span><b>Saturday Lotto lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">. It's as simple as entering your ticket number and clicking &#8216;check ticket.' </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"does-saturday-lotto-lottery-have-an-app\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1219\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Does Saturday Lotto lottery have an app?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1219\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-labelledby=\"does-saturday-lotto-lottery-have-an-app\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can use the </span><b>Saturday Lotto lottery app</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> on a multitude of devices such as a PC, laptop, tablet, or cellphone. It’s essentially a much more convenient method than visiting an outlet. The app is available for Android and iOS and includes safe payment methods such as PayPal. The convenience that the app offers is truly unbeatable. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"are-there-different-ways-to-play-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"10\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-12110\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Are There Different Ways to Play? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-12110\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"10\" aria-labelledby=\"are-there-different-ways-to-play-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. There are three different ways to play. With Standard entries, you get to choose between QuickPick or Marked entry. On the other hand, System and Pick entries provide more winning possibilities and opportunities to win across multiple prize divisions. You could also try Advanced Entries, which allows you to plan your entries, so they set off on scheduled dates. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-739da507 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"57091\" data-id=\"739da507\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-24523623\" data-eae-slider=\"91948\" data-id=\"24523623\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12a06c75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"12a06c75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the Australia Saturday Lotto? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider 